.Dd $Mdocdate: July 30 2022 $
.Dt WAYVIEWER 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm wayviewer
.Nd stream the screen of wlroots-based compositors over TCP
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm wayviewer
.Op Fl -port Ar port
.Op Fl -host Ar address
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
streams the screen of a Wayland compositor over TCP as MPEG-TS.
It captures the whole first output using
.Sy wlr-screencopy
and encodes it with
.Xr ffmpeg 1
using low-latency x264 defaults.
.Pp
It can also expose the same MPEG-TS byte stream on a Unix stream socket by
setting
.Ev WAYVIEWER_UNIX_SOCKET .
This is intended for a local Python process that forwards the stream or
renders it in a GUI.
.Pp
This program only streams video.
It does not record to files and does not
capture audio.
.Pp
The server listens on TCP port 1234 and on all interfaces by default.
Multiple clients can connect to the same port at the same time.
A slow or disconnected client does not stop the others.
Use
.Ql Ctrl+C
to stop it.
.Pp
The options are as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl -port Ar port
TCP port to listen on.
The default is 1234.
.It Fl -host Ar address
Address to bind.
The default is 0.0.0.0, which listens on all interfaces.
.It Fl h , -help
Print the help screen.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev WAYVIEWER_FPS
Capture and encode frame rate.
The default is 30.
.It Ev WAYVIEWER_BITRATE
Encoder bitrate cap in kbit/s.
The default is 5000.
.It Ev WAYVIEWER_GOP
Keyframe interval in frames.
The default is the value of
.Ev WAYVIEWER_FPS ,
which gives one keyframe per second.
.It Ev WAYVIEWER_CRF
x264/x265 quality value.
Lower values give better quality and a higher bitrate.
The default is 23.
.It Ev WAYVIEWER_PRESET
x264/x265 preset.
The default is
.Ql ultrafast ,
which uses the least CPU.
.It Ev WAYVIEWER_THREADS
Number of encoder threads.
The default is 0, which selects half of the logical CPUs, capped at 8.
.It Ev WAYVIEWER_UNIX_SOCKET
Also listen for local clients on the given Unix stream socket path.
The socket file is removed when the server exits.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Start the server with the default port:
.Dl $ wayviewer
.Pp
Use a custom port:
.Dl $ wayviewer --port 9000
.Pp
Bind only to one address:
.Dl $ wayviewer --host 192.168.1.10 --port 9000
.Pp
Also serve a local Python process on a Unix socket:
.Dl $ WAYVIEWER_UNIX_SOCKET=/run/user/1000/wayviewer.sock wayviewer
.Pp
On another device, connect to the server's IP address with
.Dl $ ffplay -probesize 65536 -analyzeduration 100000 \
    -fflags nobuffer -flags low_delay -framedrop tcp://192.168.1.10:9000
.Pp
The probe options make playback start immediately.
Without them, the MPEG-TS demuxer spends five seconds in
.Fn avformat_find_stream_info
before showing the first frame.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ffmpeg 1
